  "id": "degrees-of-freedom",
  "term": "degrees of freedom",
  "definition": "Degrees of freedom are the number of independent pieces of information available for a statistical estimate. They are generally found by taking the number of observed values and subtracting the number of parameters that had to be estimated along the way.",
